---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+15805550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(580) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="AC System Repair in Ardmore, OK | Central Air & Heat Pumps" description="Expert AC system repair in Ardmore, OK. Capacitors, compressors, coils, and full diagnostics for all major brands.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AC System Repair</h1>
      <p>Central air & heat pump repair serving Ardmore and surrounding communities.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>From failed capacitors to compressor issues, our technicians diagnose and repair central air conditioners and heat pumps from all major brands. Most repairs are completed on the first visit.</p>
      <h2>What We Repair</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Capacitors, contactors, and relays</li>
        <li>Compressors and outdoor fan motors</li>
        <li>Evaporator and condenser coils</li>
        <li>Thermostats and control boards</li>
        <li>All major brands: Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Rheem, and more</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready to Schedule?</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> for AC repair in Ardmore, OK.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
